# This file ensures the fonts directory is tracked by git
# Font files are excluded via .gitignore but users can add their own font files here

# FONT LICENSING AND SOURCES
# The Manganese theme is configured to use these specific fonts:
#
# Fira Code (Open Source)
# - Available at: https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode
# - License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
# - Files needed: FiraCode-Light.woff2, FiraCode-Regular.woff2, FiraCode-Medium.woff2,
#   FiraCode-SemiBold.woff2, FiraCode-Bold.woff2, FiraCode-VF.woff2
#
# Doves Type (Commercial)
# - Available at: https://typespec.co.uk/doves-type/
# - License: Commercial license required
# - Files needed: DovesTypeText-Regular.woff2, DovesTypeHeadline-Regular.woff2
#
# NOTE: These are the author's personal font choices. You may substitute with
# your own preferred fonts or use the fallback fonts defined in the theme.